---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = '中国240小时免签证过境（2026年）——中国入门指南';
const description = '关于中国240小时免签证过境政策，你需要知道的一切。';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-12">
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-12">
      <a href="/zh/prepare/visa/" class="text-sm text-brand-600 hover:underline inline-flex items-center gap-1 mb-4">← 签证和入境</a>
      <div class="text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium tracking-wide uppercase mb-3"><h3类=</div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 leading-tight mb-4">
        China 240-Hour Visa-Free Transit Explained
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-400">
        Can you visit China for up to 10 days without a visa?
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none">
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        <strong>关于中国240小时免签证过境政策，你需要知道的一切。</strong>
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        China's 240-hour visa-free transit policy lets eligible travelers stay in permitted regions of China for up to 10 days while traveling onward to a third country or region. For many visitors, this is one of the easiest ways to see China without applying for a traditional visa.
      </p>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">你可以在没有签证的情况下访问中国长达10天吗？</h2>

      <div class="space-y-4 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 text-sm flex items-center justify-center font-bold">✅</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium text-gray-900 m-0">有效普通护照</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 m-0">来自55个符合条件的国家之一；护照必须自抵达之日起至少3个月内有效</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 text-sm flex items-center justify-center font-bold">✅</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium text-gray-900 m-0">符合条件的行程</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 m-0">国家A→ mainland china→ 不同的国家/地区（您不能直接飞回原籍国）</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 text-sm flex items-center justify-center font-bold">✅</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium text-gray-900 m-0">已确认的续程机票</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 m-0">固定出发日期和座位，240小时内出发</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 text-sm flex items-center justify-center font-bold">✅</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium text-gray-900 m-0">批准的出入境口岸</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 m-0">在允许的时限内通过官方批准的过境口岸出入境</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-brand-50 border-l-2 border-brand-300 pl-5 py-3 my-8 not-prose">
        <p class="text-gray-600 m-0 italic text-sm">
          <strong>重要提示：</strong> This is strictly a transit policy, not a general tourist visa-free entry.
        </p>
      </div>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">符合条件与不符合条件的路线</h2>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-5">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-600 mb-3">✅ 符合条件（有效过境）</p>
          <ul class="space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-700 m-0 pl-4 list-disc">
            <li>英国→ 上海→ Japan</li>
            <li>美国→ 北京→ 韩国</li>
            <li>澳大利亚→ 广州→ 泰国</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-5">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-red-500 mb-3">❌ 不符合条件（往返）</p>
          <ul class="space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-700 m-0 pl-4 list-disc">
            <li>英国→ 上海→ 英国</li>
            <li>美国→ 北京→ 美国</li>
            <li>日本→ 上海→ Japan</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">香港/澳门/台湾算第三地区吗？</h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        <strong>对。</strong> Under official immigration rules, Hong Kong, Macau, and Taiwan are treated as separate third destinations for transit qualification.
      </p>

      <div class="bg-brand-50 border border-brand-100 rounded-2xl p-5 mb-8 not-prose">
        <p class="text-gray-700 m-0"><strong>例子：</strong> United Kingdom → Shanghai → Hong Kong = valid transit itinerary.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">你能呆多久？</h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-2">
        <strong>最长停留时间：</strong> 240 hours (10 days).
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        <strong>时钟什么时候开始？</strong> The countdown begins at 00:00 midnight on the calendar day after your entry (China local time, GMT+8) — not when your plane actually lands.
      </p>

      <div class="bg-brand-50 border border-brand-100 rounded-2xl p-5 mb-8 not-prose">
        <p class="text-gray-700 m-0"><strong>专业提示：</strong> If you arrive late in the evening, you'll get some extra practical buffer time beyond the full 10 calendar days, which is compliant with National Immigration Administration (NIA) calculation rules.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">哪些国家符合条件？</h2>

      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">Total: <strong>55个国家</strong>.</p>

      <div class="space-y-4 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-5">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">欧洲（40个国家）</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">阿尔巴尼亚、奥地利、比利时、波斯尼亚和黑塞哥维那、保加利亚、克罗地亚、塞浦路斯、捷克共和国、丹麦、爱沙尼亚、芬兰、法国、德国、希腊、匈牙利、冰岛、爱尔兰、意大利、拉脱维亚、列支敦士登、立陶宛、卢森堡、马耳他、摩纳哥、黑山、荷兰、北马其顿、挪威、波兰、葡萄牙、罗马尼亚、俄罗斯、塞尔维亚、斯洛伐克、斯洛文尼亚、西班牙、瑞典、瑞士、乌克兰、英国</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-5">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">北美（3个国家）</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">加拿大、墨西哥、美国</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-5">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">南美洲（3个国家）</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">阿根廷、巴西、智利</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-5">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">大洋洲（2个国家）</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">澳大利亚、新西兰</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-5">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">亚洲（7个国家）</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">文莱、印度尼西亚、日本、卡塔尔、新加坡、韩国、阿拉伯联合酋长国</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-brand-50 border-l-2 border-brand-300 pl-5 py-3 my-8 not-prose">
        <p class="text-gray-600 m-0 italic text-sm">
          <strong>注：</strong> The official country list is updated occasionally. Always verify the latest information via official government sources before booking flights.
        </p>
      </div>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">你可以在哪里进出中国？</h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Total approved entry/exit ports: <strong>65个端口</strong> (air, sea & rail) across 24 provincial-level regions nationwide (updated November 2025).
      </p>

      <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-5 mb-6 not-prose">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">覆盖的主要核心城市</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">北京、上海、广州、深圳、成都、重庆、西安、杭州、厦门、南京，加上合肥、南昌、贵阳、海口、三亚、太原、大同等。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-brand-50 border-l-2 border-brand-300 pl-5 py-3 my-8 not-prose">
        <p class="text-gray-600 m-0 italic text-sm">
          <strong>Important:</strong> Not all airports/seaports in China participate in the scheme. Only designated official ports qualify for 240-hour transit visa-free entry.
        </p>
      </div>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">你可以在中国旅行吗？</h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        <strong>是的，有一些限制。</strong>
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        At present, eligible visitors may travel inter-provincially within the officially designated administrative areas across 24 provinces and municipalities under the transit scheme.
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-4 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="bg-brand-50 border-l-2 border-brand-300 pl-5 py-3 not-prose">
          <p class="text-gray-600 m-0 italic text-sm">
            <strong>限制1：</strong> Some provinces only allow access to partial cities instead of the full provincial territory (Shanxi, Jiangxi, Guangxi, etc.)
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-brand-50 border-l-2 border-brand-300 pl-5 py-3 not-prose">
          <p class="text-gray-600 m-0 italic text-sm">
            <strong>限制2：</strong> You cannot travel to provinces outside the approved 24-region list (Xinjiang, Tibet, Inner Mongolia, etc. are excluded)
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">你需要什么文件？</h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Prepare these documents for airline check-in and border immigration inspection:
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-4 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 text-sm flex items-center justify-center font-bold">✅</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium text-gray-900 m-0">有效护照原件</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 m-0">剩余有效期至少3个月</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 text-sm flex items-center justify-center font-bold">✅</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium text-gray-900 m-0">Confirmed onward ticket</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 m-0">登机前所需的固定出发日期和座位；不接受开放日期的门票</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 text-sm flex items-center justify-center font-bold">✅</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium text-gray-900 m-0">详细旅行行程</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 m-0">展示您在中国计划的活动</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 text-sm flex items-center justify-center font-bold">✅</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium text-gray-900 m-0">酒店/住宿预订证明</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 m-0">边境当局强烈建议</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-brand-50 border-l-2 border-brand-300 pl-5 py-3 my-8 not-prose">
        <p class="text-gray-600 m-0 italic text-sm">
          <strong>Note:</strong> Airlines will pre-screen your eligibility at departure. Chinese immigration officers reserve the right to request supplementary paperwork upon arrival.
        </p>
      </div>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">您可以将此政策用于旅游吗？</h2>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-5">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-600 mb-3">✅ 允许的活动</p>
          <ul class="space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-700 m-0 pl-4 list-disc">
            <li>观光旅游</li>
            <li>短期商务访问和客户会议</li>
            <li>家庭团聚和个人探访</li>
            <li>短期文化交流</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-5">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-red-500 mb-3">❌ 严格禁止</p>
          <ul class="space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-700 m-0 pl-4 list-disc">
            <li>任何有偿工作或工作</li>
            <li>全职长期研究</li>
            <li>专业新闻或媒体拍摄</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Want to know more? Check out:
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-2 mb-8 not-prose">
        <a href="/zh/prepare/visa/visa-guide/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium hover:underline">2026年获得中国签证有多容易？ →</a><br/>
        <a href="/zh/prepare/visa/visa-free/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium hover:underline">中国免签证国家名单（2026年）→</a><br/>
        <a href="#" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium hover:underline">如何申请中国旅游签证→</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
